---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Vimeo Alternative for Creators" seo={{ page_description: "Why creators are moving from Vimeo to uVideoPlayer for hosting." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 prose">
    <h1>The Vimeo Alternative Built for Creators</h1>
    <p class="lead">Vimeo has shifted focus to enterprise video marketing. If you just want a clean, fast player on your website without paying hundreds of dollars a month, you need an alternative.</p>

    <h2>Why creators are leaving Vimeo</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Enterprise pivot:</strong> Small creators are being pushed to expensive tiers when they exceed arbitrary bandwidth caps.</li>
      <li><strong>Complex pricing:</strong> Per-seat licensing and hidden costs.</li>
      <li><strong>Bloated player:</strong> Too many features you don't need slowing down your page load times.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>uVideoPlayer vs Vimeo</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Feature</th>
          <th>uVideoPlayer</th>
          <th>Vimeo (Starter/Standard)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Unbranded Player</td>
          <td>Yes (Always)</td>
          <td>Requires higher tier</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Custom Colors</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Pricing Model</td>
          <td>Pay-as-you-go ($5/mo + $0.02/GB)</td>
          <td>Fixed tiers (Seat-based)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Focus</td>
          <td>Independent creators & websites</td>
          <td>Enterprise & B2B teams</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-[var(--color-bg-base)] p-8 rounded border border-[var(--color-border)] not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Make the switch today</h3>
      <p class="mb-6 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Stop overpaying for features you don't use.</p>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="inline-block rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-5 py-3 font-medium text-white hover:bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)]">View Pricing</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
